msgstr "Core-Dashboard-Widgets von WooCommerce umbenennen"

msgid "Rename the main WooCommerce menu"
msgstr "WooCommerce-Hauptmenü umbenennen"

msgid "Replace WooCommerce in PHP-translated admin labels"
msgstr "WooCommerce in PHP-übersetzten Admin-Texten ersetzen"

